# Cloudflare Pages rewrite rules.
#
# I. Why a catch-all rewrite exists
#
# The game currently lives on a single route, so the rewrite is not strictly
# required. It is included because every URL that is not a static asset must
# resolve to the application shell: without it, a future `/play/:worldId` route
# or a deep link shared between players would return Pages' 404 page instead of
# letting the client router decide. Cloudflare serves real files first, so
# `assets/*` requests are unaffected.

